   Q('mcq', 'According to Josh, what do whistled languages reproduce?', 'C', 'The whistle copies the changes in pitch and rhythm', 'Whistles copy pitch and rhythm.', opts=['the vocabulary of birdsong', 'a simplified grammar', 'the pitch and rhythm of speech']),
